flowchart LR
  C[Mobile and Web Channels] --> ALB[Application Load Balancer]
  ALB --> API[Stateless API / Transfer Service]
  API --> W[(PostgreSQL Writer Endpoint)]
  W -. synchronous HA replication .-> S[(Multi-AZ Standby)]
  W -. asynchronous / managed read replication .-> R[(Read Replica / Reader Endpoint)]
  API --> OUT[Outbox / Event Publisher]
  OUT --> EVT[Notifications and Analytics]
  W --> BK[(Automated Backups / PITR)]
  BK --> DR[(Cross-Region Recovery Copy)]
  R --> DASH[Statements and Operations Reports]
